  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.18 - on SpawnDev.ILGPU 5.4.34 (accurate WebGPU / WebGL sin / cos; faster CPU accelerator launches). Checked against ComfyUI's own runs: FLUX.1 Krea fp8_scaled, Qwen-Image (text encoder, 20B transformer, VAE) and Qwen-Image Edit 2509 (TextEncodeQwenImageEditPlus: the Qwen2.5-VL vision tower QwenVisionEncoder, conditioning with pictures and M-RoPE, the transformer with reference latents in ComfyUI's layout). CLIP vision ViT-H (ClipVisionEncoder, ComfyUI's clip_vision_h). Flux2TextEncoder encodes any prompt length per call. GGUF batch decoder: min-p and the presence penalty (ComfyUI's TextGenerate sampling), min-p accepts 1.0. Rotary embeddings from host cos / sin tables. LICENSE names this package. See CHANGELOG.md.",
